[en.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_1]
Ammunition Botany

[en.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_1_desc]
This traditional and ancient field of earth pony studies explores how to turn plant fruits into specialty ammunition or improve the combustion efficiency of mixed explosives.

[zh.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_1]
弹药植物学

[zh.IDEA_C12_AMMUNITION_BOTANY_1_desc]
这门传统而古老的陆马学科研究如何将植物的果实制成特式弹药或者提高混合炸药的燃烧效率
